<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals reach 2.71 mln bags by Feb 2.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals reach 2.71 mln bags by Feb 2.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 43,635 bags in the week ending Feb 2 compared to 28,130 bags in the corresponding week to Feb 5 last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said in a statement.</p>
<p>Total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to-date were 2,714,537 bags against 2,379,039 bags in 1995/96, it added.</p>
<p>--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417</p>
</text>
